│  **Comprehensive 7-Day Travel Plan for Madrid**                                                 │
│                                                                                                 │
│  Welcome to Madrid, a city that seamlessly blends art, history, food, and culture. As a local   │
│  expert, I'm excited to share with you the best tips, hidden gems, and practical advice to      │
│  make your trip to Madrid an unforgettable experience.                                          │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 1: Arrival and Exploration                                                             │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Arrive at Adolfo Suárez Madrid–Barajas Airport (MAD) and take a taxi or metro       │
│  (Line 8) to your hotel.                                                                        │
│  * Afternoon: Check-in to your hotel and freshen up. Visit the nearby **Puerta del Sol**, a     │
│  famous square in the heart of the city, and explore the surrounding streets lined with shops   │
│  and cafes.                                                                                     │
│  * Evening: Head to **Plaza Mayor** for dinner and people-watching at this historic square.     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 2: Art and Culture                                                                     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Visit the **Museo del Prado**, one of the world's greatest art museums, featuring   │
│  works by Goya, Velázquez, and El Greco.                                                        │
│  * Afternoon: Explore the nearby **Royal Palace of Madrid**, a stunning palace showcasing       │
│  Spanish architecture and history.                                                              │
│  * Evening: Enjoy a traditional flamenco show at **Tablao Flamenco Cordobés**.                  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 3: Tapas and Markets                                                                   │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Join a guided tapas tour to explore the city's culinary scene and sample local      │
│  specialties.                                                                                   │
│  * Afternoon: Visit the bustling **El Rastro Market**, a flea market on Sundays offering        │
│  everything from vintage clothing to antique furniture.                                         │
│  * Evening: Wander through the charming streets of **Malasaña**, lined with quirky shops,       │
│  cafes, and street art.                                                                         │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 4: Parks and Gardens                                                                   │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Relax in **Retiro Park**, a beautiful park with gardens, fountains, and             │
│  sculptures, perfect for a peaceful break from the city.                                        │
│  * Afternoon: Explore the nearby **Parque del Oeste**, a lesser-known park with stunning views  │
│  of the city and a beautiful rose garden.                                                       │
│  * Evening: Enjoy dinner at a local restaurant, trying traditional Madrid dishes like tapas,    │
│  paella, and jamón ibérico.                                                                     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 5: Fashion and Shopping                                                                │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Visit the **Madrid Fashion Week** (if scheduled during your trip) or explore the    │
│  nearby **Gran Vía**, a shopping street lined with high-end boutiques.                          │
│  * Afternoon: Browse the stalls at **Mercado de San Miguel**, a historic market offering local  │
│  specialties and souvenirs.                                                                     │
│  * Evening: Experience the city's nightlife by visiting one of the many tablaos (flamenco       │
│  bars) in the Malasaña neighborhood.                                                            │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 6: History and Architecture                                                            │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Visit the **Almudena Cathedral** and explore the nearby **Reina Sofia Museum**,     │
│  home to Picasso's Guernica.                                                                    │
│  * Afternoon: Explore the historic center, including the **Plaza de la Puerta del Sol** and     │
│  the **Calle de la Luna**, a charming street in the Malasaña neighborhood.                      │
│  * Evening: Enjoy dinner at a traditional restaurant and relax with a stroll through the city.  │
│                                                                                                 │
│  ### Day 7: Departure                                                                           │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Morning: Spend the morning shopping for last-minute souvenirs or visiting any attractions    │
│  you may have missed earlier in the trip.                                                       │
│  * Afternoon: Take a taxi or metro (Line 8) back to the airport for your departure flight.      │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Weather Forecast**                                                                           │
│                                                                                                 │
│  | Month | Average High Temp. | Average Low Temp. |                                             │
│  | --- | --- | --- |                                                                            │
│  | Feb | 12°C (54°F) | 4°C (39°F) |                                                             │
│  | Mar | 17°C (63°F) | 9°C (48°F) |                                                             │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Packing Suggestions:**                                                                       │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Pack layers for chilly winter mornings and evenings.                                         │
│  * Bring comfortable walking shoes for exploring the city.                                      │
│  * Don't forget to try some local specialties along the way!                                    │
│                                                                                                 │
│  **Budget Breakdown:**                                                                          │
│                                                                                                 │
│  * Accommodation: €50-€100 per night (approx. $55-$110 USD)                                     │
│  * Food: €20-€30 per meal (approx. $22-$33 USD)                                                 │
│  * Transportation: €2-€3 per ride (approx. $2.20-$3.30 USD)                                     │
│                                                                                                 │
│  By following this comprehensive 7-day travel plan, you'll be well on your way to experiencing  │
│  the best of Madrid. Enjoy your trip!                                                           │
│                                                                                                 │
